            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Mz White"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I loved the texture the egg mixture gave the fish. I added flour to cornmeal mixture to help hold breading on fish.",
            "datePublished": "2020-09-19T02:11:42.773Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "medouglas"
            },
            "reviewBody": "A very nice, very authentic southern recipe. I didn't have buttermilk so I made my own with regular milk and lemon juice - worked just fine. I wanted extra crispy, so I also added a second dredge through the cornmeal mix, with a dip in egg between the first and second dredge. Was excellent, without being too much.",
            "datePublished": "2014-02-02T10:59:42.470Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "2"
